From 74320edd8adb8b09eaa990cefd16be248bb10ff6 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: Akash Srivastava <akashniki@gmail.com>
Date: Thu, 29 Oct 2026 22:08:06 +0100
Subject: [PATCH 4/5] components: follow the feat/ipados27-gpu-parity heads
 (2026-10-29)

The catalog revisions are what "unixnu fetch" clones when a driver
submodule is not checked out, and the only source for ShengUfs and
ShengHidInput. Several still named the 2026-10-24 docs commits, older than
the gitlinks: ShengUfs e2b32cc4 predates "use the VM interfaces public in
newer XNU" and the source storage root layout. Point every component that
has an ipados27 branch at its head:

ArmCpu 4bd3230f, DarwinBoot 3e3a8a96, Adreno740 c66357f2,
AdrenoMetal 547312cf, ShengUfs fab07fcc, ShengHidInput 24f1f3fb,
GopFramebuffer 90b64efc, RamBlock 4be2d7eb, VirtioMmioBlock f4dfce67,
XnuPrelink 76452c6e, ArmSmmu4K 1811b6d1, VerifiedRoot ed368a8d.

AdrenoMetal also moves its gitlink from 9edbe61c back to 547312cf:
upstream rewound both UniXNU and AdrenoMetal's feat/ipados27-gpu-parity
past 9edbe61c (backdrops off the compute path) and 6ad1297's parent.

Change-Id: I650b1e3dd818a5fa5e2ed4b11f210efa7b9193a8
